              "text": "i used to bartend at this tiki spot downtown, chaotic but fun. now i just do my own thing with photos n stuff, way better vibes. whats the worst part of those warehouse shifts fr"
            },
            {
              "who": "fan",
              "text": "yeah the heavy lifting and shitty bosses kill me fr what was the craziest night at that tiki bar"
            },
            {
              "who": "creator",
              "text": "lol one night this bachelor party rolled in and got so rowdy we had to kick em out, but not before one dude tried swingin from the fake palm tree. absolute chaos fr. whats the wildest thing thats gone down at your warehouse"
            },
            {
              "who": "fan",
              "text": "haha thats nuts we had a guy get stuck in the forklift once total mess what u up to tonight"
            },
