              "who": "fan",
              "text": "prolly just netflix and chill with whiskers hes been meowing non stop what storms u talkin about"
            },
            {
              "who": "creator",
              "text": "Aw whiskers demandin all the cuddles huh. austin gets these random thunderstorms, lowkey love watchin em roll in. whatcha plannin to watch on netflix babe"
