            {
              "who": "creator",
              "text": "mostly alone these days, biscuit curls up sometimes but he's more chaos than chill lol. u binge those docs solo or with someone"
            },
            {
              "who": "fan",
              "text": "usually solo too whiskers is my only company lol u get spooked watchin mindhunter by yourself"
            },
            {
              "who": "creator",
              "text": "Haha i get a lil jumpy sometimes, especially if its super late. but lowkey adds to the vibe. any true crime doc thats actually freaked u out at work the next day"
            },
            {
              "who": "fan",
              "text": "yeah that dont f with cats one messed me up couldnt trust anyone the next shift lol u got one that kept u up"
