              "text": "haha mine knocks over water bowls all the time whats biscuits fave spot to nap"
            },
            {
              "who": "creator",
              "text": "yours sounds cozy on the lap, mine would prob be batting at my phone rn"
            },
            {
              "who": "fan",
              "text": "haha yeah laps are prime real estate biscuits a cuddler or more independent"
            },
