              "text": "Yea biscuits keeps me on my toes lol"
            },
            {
              "who": "fan",
              "text": "u keep dodging my questions about ur job kinda weird lol whats up with that"
            },
            {
              "who": "creator",
              "text": "mostly this fanvue thing now, quit bartending a while back. way chiller and i set my own hours"
