            {
              "who": "fan",
              "text": "yeah bartending does sound rough with the weirdos glad u switched what kinda hours u keep now"
            },
            {
              "who": "creator",
              "text": "Whats the most boring part of ur data entry day tho"
            },
            {
              "who": "fan",
              "text": "staring at spreadsheets for hours is the worst u got any fun stories from bartending days"
            },
            {
              "who": "creator",
              "text": "Spreadsheets sound soul-sucking fr, i keep like 11am to 3am now, way better for my vibe"
            },
            {
              "who": "fan",
              "text": "soul sucking for sure u got any wild bartending stories tho"
            },
            {
              "who": "creator",
              "text": "fun story: one night this dude tried tipping with a live frog, had to chase it around the bar lol"
